# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: The Swarm Grows (1147), Parts of the Swarm (1148), Hardened Shells (1105), Load
# Lightening (1176), A Bump in the Road (1175), Family Tree (5361), Alliance Relations (1436),
# Martek the Exiled (1106), Hate the Hatefury (97265), Rocket Car Parts (1110), Salt Flat Venom
# (1104), Hemet Nesingwary (5762).
# Left out: Bodyguard for Hire (5821), Claim Rackmore's Treasure! (6161), Gelkis Alliance (1368),
# Bone Collector (5501).
# Hate the Hatefury is optional (#1314): nobody has been recorded taking it, and Aka'rai was never seen, even by players passing her spot.

# The Shimmering Flats at 33-34, then Desolace's 33-36 quests at 34-35. Desolace's 38-40 quests
# (Melizza and the ghost-o-plasm, Taiga's portals, the centaur totems) come on a short second
# visit at 38, from Ratchet, in forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh, as both other orders
# leave them for a later visit; the Hand of Iruxos and the Book of the Ancients are done here.
#
# Flow: the Undercity (where the previous guide ends) -> zeppelin to Orgrimmar (Hunter and
# Shaman training) -> fly to Freewind Post -> Moktar Krin -> the Mirage
# Raceway -> the southern flats and the silithid dig -> Moktar Krin -> basilisks, tortoises and
# vultures -> the
# raceway -> Freewind Post (Family Tree) -> fly to Sun Rock Retreat -> ride into
# Desolace: Scrabblescrew's Camp, Ghost Walker Post -> the Kodo Graveyard -> Shadowprey Village
# (flight path, bind) -> the clam beds and Sar'theris Strand -> Ethel Rethor -> Thunder Axe
# Fortress -> Ethel Rethor and the Book of the Ancients -> Sargeron -> Kolkar Village -> Ghost
# Walker Post -> Shadowprey, where the next guide flies to Orgrimmar.
#
# Optional extras:
# - The Corrupter (1480): the Flayed Demon Skin that starts it drops at 1-5% from the Burning
#   Blade; it is handed in at Ghost Walker Post if it drops. Its follow-ups (the Shadowstalker
#   scalp at Sargeron, the Oracle Crystal on the coast) would take the loop back: leave them.
# - Bodyguard for Hire (5821): the Gizelton caravan runs on a timer; escort it if it waits by
#   the road on the way in, otherwise ride on.
#
# Left out:
# - Bone Collector (5501, level 39): Bibbly stands at Kormek's Hut, north of the Kodo Graveyard
#   where its bones lie. Taken on the ride in, it is five levels over at about 33; later, it
#   would be a walk back north from the graveyard and back for 2,250 XP.
# - Gelkis Alliance and Magram Alliance (1368, 1367) need Friendly standing with the clan,
#   earned only by killing the rival clan, and their follow-ups go with them.
# - Claim Rackmore's Treasure! (6161): its two keys drop at 10-15% from crabs south of
#   Shadowprey and naga on the northern coast, and the chest sits on an island off the far
#   north.
#
# Class training: Hunters and Shamans in Orgrimmar at the start, Druids in Thunder Bluff on the
# flight to Freewind Post. Shamans hand the Shard of Water to Islen Waterseer by Ratchet on the
# way (Call of Water 96: your Water Totem), and take Call of Air (1531, offered from level 30)
# from Searn Firewarder on the Orgrimmar stop for Prate Cloudseer by Freewind Post.
#
# All the Mirage Raceway's quests are worked in one visit here (Rocket Car Parts and Salt Flat
# Venom used to be done alone at 29-30 at the end of forever/horde/07-ashenvale): Fizzle offers
# Martek the Exiled (1106) only once both Salt Flat Venom (1104) and Hardened Shells (1105) are
# handed in.
#
# Carried on: Parts of the Swarm (1148) for Korran at the Crossroads, Load Lightening's Goblin
# Sponsorship (1178) for Gazlowe and Kravel's parts order (Wharfmaster Dizzywig, 1111) for the
# docks in Ratchet, and Centaur Bounty (1366) for the second Desolace
# visit (forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh); Alliance Relations (1436) and Hunting in
# Stranglethorn (5763) for the next guide.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orgrimmar

step Zeppelin to Orgrimmar
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  goto 60.7,58.8 "Zeppelin to Orgrimmar"

step Alliance Relations
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip The zeppelin lands at the tower outside Orgrimmar's main gate. Craven Drok waits in the Drag; Keldran stands in the Valley of Spirits on the west side of the city.
  accept 1431                         -- Craven Drok: offered from level 30
  turnin 1431                         -- Keldran
  accept 1432                         -- for Takata Steelblade in Desolace, later in this guide

step Orgrimmar trainers
  only Hunter,Shaman
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Train while you are in the city.
  train class

step Searn Firewarder
  only Shaman
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Searn Firewarder stands in the Valley of Wisdom.
  accept 1531                         -- Searn Firewarder: for Prate Cloudseer by Freewind Post, later in this guide

step Nogg
  when dungeon "Gnomeregan"
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Nogg's workshop is in the Valley of Honor. Rig Wars is Gnomeregan's last boss: great XP if you run it with a group. Run it whenever your group is ready; hand it in on a later Orgrimmar stop.
  accept 2841                         -- Nogg

step Gnomeregan
  when dungeon "Gnomeregan"
  note Run Gnomeregan with a group when it suits you: Mekgineer Thermaplugg at the end drops his Safe Combination; open his safe behind the northern bomb pillar for the Rig Blueprints.

step Orgrimmar flight master
  zone Orgrimmar
  goto 45.3,63.7 "Orgrimmar flight master"

step Thunder Bluff
  only Druid
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Fly from Orgrimmar to Thunder Bluff and train with Turak Runetotem on Elder Rise; fly on to Freewind Post from there.
  fly "Thunder Bluff"
  train class

step Islen Waterseer
  only Shaman
  zone The Barrens
  tip Fly from Orgrimmar to Ratchet. Islen Waterseer camps on the coast a short walk south of the town; fly on to Freewind Post from Ratchet.
  fly "Ratchet"
  turnin 96                           -- Islen Waterseer: Healing Stream Totem and your Water Totem

step Fly to Freewind Post
  only Druid
  zone Thunder Bluff
  goto 46.7,49.9 "Thunder Bluff flight master"
  fly "Freewind Post"
  zone Thousand Needles

step Fly to Freewind Post
  only Shaman
  zone The Barrens
  goto 63.1,37.1 "Ratchet flight master"
  fly "Freewind Post"
  zone Thousand Needles

step Fly to Freewind Post
  only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Paladin,Mage,Warlock
  zone Orgrimmar
  fly "Freewind Post"
  zone Thousand Needles

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Freewind Post

step Prate Cloudseer
  only Shaman
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip Prate Cloudseer hides in a small cave in the canyon wall north-east of the post, on the way east.
  turnin 1531                         -- Prate Cloudseer: your Air Totem
  note Prate also starts Elemental Aid (Razorfen Kraul), the 33-40 chain to The Tempest's Weapons: forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Shimmering Flats

step Moktar Krin
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip Take the lift down and follow the canyon east. Moktar Krin camps on the north-western edge of the salt flats.
  turnin 1146                         -- Moktar Krin
  accept 1147

