step The southern flats
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip South of the raceway, the Saltstone Crystalhides (32-33) and Gazers (34-35) roam the far end of the flats.
  kill 4151 quest 1175.2 @78.4,87.9 map 1441
  kill 4150 quest 1175.3 @77.1,88.4 map 1441

step The Rustmaul Dig Site
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip West of them the silithid swarm the dig site. Searchers and Hive Drones walk among the mounds; the Invaders (34-35) stay inside the hive cave. The first silithid you kill drops a Cracked Silithid Carapace: open it.
  tip Careful: Hive Drones call for help when they fall to 20% health.
  kill 4130 quest 1147.1 @69.8,83.3 map 1441
  kill 4133 quest 1147.2 @68.0,85.7 map 1441
  kill 4131 quest 1147.3 @64.8,86.0 map 1441
  collect 5877 x1
  accept 1148 item 5877

step Parts of the Swarm
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip Keep killing silithid at the dig site for the heart, the talons and the carapaces.
  collect 5855 quest 1148.1
  collect 5854 quest 1148.2
  collect 5853 quest 1148.3

step Moktar Krin
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip North from the dig to Moktar Krin's camp on the western edge of the flats.
  turnin 1147

step Shimmering Flats: kill these as you meet them
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip East onto the flats. The Saltstone Basilisks (30-31) sun themselves north-west of it; the Sparkleshell tortoises crowd round a half-buried ship in the north-east, and the Salt Flats Scavengers and Vultures circle the eastern flats. Every vulture drops a bone, about one tortoise in three a shell.
  tip Careful: Scavengers and Vultures use Execute when your health is low; the Snappers (34-35) hit hardest of the tortoises.
  kill 4147 quest 1175.1 @75.7,57.3 map 1441
  collect 5795 quest 1105 @82.1,55.0 map 1441 -- Hardened Tortoise Shell
  collect 5848 quest 1176 @87.9,65.4 map 1441 -- Hollow Vulture Bone
  collect 5798 quest 1110             -- Rocket Car Rubble, all over the northern flats
  collect 5794 quest 1104             -- Salt Flat Venom, from the Scorpid Reavers of the north half

step Mirage Raceway
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip South-west back to the raceway.
  turnin 1110                         -- Kravel Koalbeard
  accept 1111                         -- Kravel Koalbeard: his parts order goes to Wharfmaster Dizzywig in Ratchet, later on the route
  turnin 1104                         -- Fizzle Brassbolts
  turnin 1105                         -- Wizzle Brassbolts
  accept 1106                         -- Fizzle Brassbolts: his letter goes to Martek in the Badlands, at 39
  turnin 1176                         -- Pozzik
  accept 1178                         -- Pozzik: for Gazlowe in Ratchet, later on the route
  turnin 1175                         -- Trackmaster Zherin

step Level 32.5
  when level<32.5
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip Desolace's quests are 33-38. Still below 32.5 after the raceway's hand-ins? Keep killing the Sparkleshell Snappers on the flats just north of the raceway until level 32.5. Or, with a group, run the Scarlet Monastery dungeon (Graveyard or Library) instead.
  goto 77.5,70.5 map 1441 "Sparkleshell Snappers"
  level 32.5 grind 4143               -- grind on Sparkleshell Snapper

step Freewind Post
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip West back to Freewind Post. Cliffwatcher Longhorn stands in the middle of the post, on the way to the flight master.
  accept 5361                         -- Cliffwatcher Longhorn: for Nataka Longhorn in Desolace, next
  vendor nearest

