step Level 33
  when level<33
  zone Desolace
  tip Shadowprey's Hand of Iruxos and the coast's naga want 33. Below that? The Scorpashi Lashers on the slopes north of Smeed's camp are on your way west: kill them until level 33. Or, with a group, run the Scarlet Monastery dungeon (Library) instead.
  goto 59.9,54.6 map 1443 "Scorpashi Lashers"
  level 33 grind 4697                 -- grind on Scorpashi Lasher

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The west coast

step Shadowprey Village
  zone Desolace
  tip Head west to the troll village on the coast, keeping clear of the Gelkis Village on the way. Aka'rai stands on the path just north of the village.
  tip Aka'rai may not be here on Forever: if Aka'rai doesn't offer Hate the Hatefury, skip it.
  accept 97265 optional               -- Aka'rai: the Hatefury satyrs of Sargeron, later in this guide
  accept 5381                         -- Taiga Wisemane
  sethome "Shadowprey Village"        -- Innkeeper Sikewa
  accept 5763                         -- Roon Wildmane: for Hemet Nesingwary in Stranglethorn, next guide
  accept 6143                         -- Drulzegar Skraghook
  accept 6142                         -- Mai'Lahii
  getfp "Shadowprey Village"          -- Thalon, at the village's south-west end

step Clam beds
  zone Desolace
  tip Head north up the coast. Giant Softshell Clams lie in the shallows and the Enraged Reef Crawlers walk the beach: each clam you open on the sea floor, and some crawlers, give a Soft-shelled Clam. Open each one in your bags for its meat.
  interact 177784 quest 6142.1 @30.6,31.9 map 1443 -- Giant Softshell Clams, on the sea floor
  use 15874 quest 6142.1 @30.6,31.9 map 1443 -- Soft-shelled Clam: open it in your bags
  collect 15924 quest 6142            -- Underwater

step Sar'theris Strand
  zone Desolace
  tip Keep north to Sar'theris Strand. The Slitherblade Myrmidons, Naga and Sorceresses hold the beach; pull them one at a time.
  kill 4714 quest 6143.1
  kill 4711 quest 6143.2
  kill 4712 quest 6143.3

step Ethel Rethor
  zone Desolace
  tip Azore Aldamort waits in the ruined tower of Ethel Rethor, inland to the east.
  accept 5741                         -- Azore Aldamort

step Thunder Axe Fortress
  zone Desolace
  tip Head east to Thunder Axe Fortress. Beat a Burning Blade cultist down, then use the Burning Gem on it before it dies to fill one Infused Burning Gem. The Burning Blade Seer stands on the fortress's top floor with the Sceptre. The cultists also drop a Flayed Demon Skin now and then (1-5%); if one drops, read it. Hand of Iruxos: clear the middle of the largest building, then use the Demon Pick on the red Hand of Iruxos Crystal there. A Demon Spirit (37) comes out: kill it for the Demon Box.
  collect 6435 quest 1435
  collect 15750 quest 5741 @55.2,30.1 -- On the top floor
  use 14523 quest 5381.1 @55.0,26.7 map 1443 -- Demon Pick, on the Hand of Iruxos Crystal
  collect 13542 quest 5381
  collect 20310 x1 optional
  accept 1480 optional

step Ethel Rethor
  zone Desolace
  tip Back west to Azore.
  turnin 5741                         -- Azore Aldamort
  accept 6027

step The Book of the Ancients
  zone Desolace
  tip The Slitherblade naga hold the coast north of Ethel Rethor. Swim out to Ranazjar Isle off the far northern tip and use the Gem of the Serpent on the Serpent Statue: Lord Kragaru (38) rises; kill him for the Book of the Ancients. He is well above you: rest to full first.
  use 15766 quest 6027.1 @28.2,6.7 map 1443 -- Gem of the Serpent, on the Serpent Statue
  collect 15803 quest 6027

step Azore Aldamort
  zone Desolace
  turnin 6027

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North-east

step Sargeron
  zone Desolace
  tip Head east past Thunder Axe Fortress and along the northern hills to the satyrs' ruins of Sargeron. Kill every kind you meet for Aka'rai; the Shadowstalkers walk unseen.
  tip Careful: Hatefury Rogues use Hide when they spawn, so they are stealthed until you find them.
  kill 4670 quest 1434.1
  kill 4672 quest 1434.2
  kill 4673 quest 1434.3
  kill 4675 quest 1434.4
  kill 4674 quest 97265.3 optional @75.7,15.8 map 1443 -- Hatefury Shadowstalker
  kill 4675 quest 97265.2 optional
  kill 4671 quest 97265.1 optional @76.5,20.5 map 1443 -- Hatefury Trickster, on the way south
  kill 4672 quest 97265.4 optional
  kill 4670 quest 97265.5 optional

step Khan Dez'hepah
  zone Desolace
  tip South to Kolkar Village. Khan Dez'hepah (35) walks among the tents on the east side with a Battle Lord or two (32-33): clear around him, then pull him alone at full health.
  tip Careful: Kolkar Battle Lords call nearby allies within 30 yd once they fall to 20% health.
  collect 6066 quest 1365

step Ghost Walker Post
  zone Desolace
  tip South-west down the road to the post.
  turnin 1434                         -- Takata Steelblade
  turnin 1435                         -- Maurin Bonesplitter
  turnin 1480 optional
  accept 1436                         -- Takata Steelblade: for Keldran in Orgrimmar, next guide
  note Takata's next errand sends you after a demon lord with an elite guard: skip it.
  turnin 1365                         -- Felgur Twocuts
  accept 1366                         -- for the second Desolace visit, in forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Shadowprey

step Shadowprey Village
  zone Desolace
  tip West to Shadowprey: your hearthstone is bound there.
  turnin 97265 npc 268705 optional    -- Aka'rai, on the path just north of the village
  turnin 5381                         -- Taiga Wisemane
